---------Problem Statement Title-------------
AI-Based Detection and Classification of Industrial Fires and Persistent Thermal Sources Using NASA FIRMS, OSM & Satellite Data
----------Proposed Solution (Summary)---------
NASA FIRMS alone flags heat but cannot explain what is causing it. THERMO-SHIELD INDIA converts raw satellite heat detections into a verified, explainable, never-fabricated national thermal-incident feed for regulators across India. It clusters raw detections into real events using DBSCAN, tracks their persistence and growth, classifies them using a GIS-aware rule engine upgraded by LightGBM, computes an explainable 0-100 risk score with momentum tracking, and routes verified incidents through a human-in-the-loop review process before any model reaches production.
